<%#
  Cloudflare Turnstile widget partial
  Usage:
    <%= render "shared/cloudflare_turnstile" %>

  Configuration:
  - Requires credentials:
      rails credentials:edit
      cloudflare_turnstile:
        site_key: YOUR_PUBLIC_SITE_KEY
        secret_key: YOUR_SECRET_KEY
  - The Stimulus controller reads the site key from credentials and renders the widget.
  - You can override size/theme by passing locals if desired, e.g.:
      <%= render "shared/cloudflare_turnstile", size: "flexible", theme: "light" %>
    and then bind those locals to data attributes below if you extend the partial.

  Notes:
  - Ensure the layout includes the Turnstile script (see application.html.erb).
  - The controller will disable the submit button until the challenge is solved.
%>
<div data-controller="turnstile"
     class="mt-4"
     data-turnstile-sitekey-value="<%= Rails.application.credentials.dig(:cloudflare_turnstile, :site_key) %>"
     data-turnstile-size-value="flexible"
     data-turnstile-theme-value="light">
  <div data-turnstile-target="turnstile"></div>
</div>
